# Credits

The Blockie frontend builds on the CPU-rendered UI layers carved from funeOS (GPL-3.0-or-later with
funeOS's additional permission); see LICENSE.

Cover art and name resolution use libretro data, fetched at runtime and cached on the device, not
redistributed in this repo or the image:

